      "name": "Killing Zone",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "astraActor21Item",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>If a Tempestus Scion deals a Wound to a target with a Ranged Attack, until the beginning of the Tempestus Scion's next turn, any other Tempestus Scions who make a Ranged Attack against the same target gain +1 SL to their Attack Test.   Shock Trooper: If the Tempestus Scion attacks and their target is surprised, the target must make a Challenging (+0) Discipline (Fear) Test or be Frightened. If all party members are Frightened their Superiority is reduced to 0.</p>"
        },
